Provenance review
=================

The six files under provenance/30b-run/source/ are the project's frozen
runtime snapshot. The continuing implementation under src/ wraps the external
KellerJordan/Muon optimizer and FlashAttention-3 interfaces; it does not vendor
those projects. PyTorch, NumPy, FlashAttention, Muon, the TinyLlama tokenizer,
and referenced datasets remain third-party projects under their own licenses.
No third-party source license texts need to be reproduced here because their
source code is not redistributed in this repository.

The Apache-2.0 grant covers original project content. It does not relicense
external checkpoints, token datasets, the TinyLlama tokenizer, or quoted expert
correspondence. Those external checkpoints and datasets are not included.
Expert names and quotations are retained as attribution and scientific context,
not as endorsements. Permission to redistribute private correspondence is not
documented in the repository and must be confirmed before publishing those
quotations.

Raw run records under provenance/30b-run/ are historical evidence, not a claim
that the recorded absolute paths, checkpoints, or datasets are available in
this checkout. Downstream benchmark result JSON files referenced by the report
generators are absent; the committed benchmark CSV tables are derived evidence
and are identified as such in the documentation.
